@bank all
// N6 (2026-10-27, Pillar 5 Step 6, S6-1 the night shift; stand-in words, no head writer): the night shift's texts, for
// 28a's p5nText (worksText). Said by nobody unless noted. Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds Calder).
// {time}: a time like 21:00; {from}: the night's start; {hours}: your hours tonight. Scenes: night.on, night.off.

// ---- the time clock at night ----
== night.clock.in
- Clocked in at {time}. Night shift till 06:00.
== night.clock.out
- Clocked out at {time}. {hours} h tonight.
== night.clock.early
- An early finish: it's noted.
== night.clock.over
- The night shift's over. Get some sleep.
== night.clock.done
- You're clocked out. Bed, then.
== night.clock.auto
- You forgot to clock out. The clock signed you out at 06:00.
== night.screen.ready
- Night shift {from}-06:00. Tap to clock in.
== night.screen.on
- On the night shift since {time}.
== night.screen.done
- Night done. Sleep well.
== night.screen.over
- The night shift's over.
== night.screen.hours
- Tonight: {hours} h
== night.screen.didin
- Clocked in at {time}. Quiet night, with luck.
== night.screen.didout
- Clocked out at {time}. Bed.

// ---- the Schedule and Tracked ----
== night.row
- Night shift, {from}-06:00
== night.row.told
- Night shift tonight, after the comet
== night.row.end
- Night shift, until 06:00
== night.row.sleep
- Sleep until {time}
== night.where
- the time clock, then the engine room, Deck 6

// ---- sleeping by day, the knock, the kept plate ----
== night.bed.until
- Sleep until {time}
== night.bed.on
- You're on the night shift. Sleep after 06:00.
== night.wake
- Your alarm. Night shift tonight from {time}.
== night.knock
- A knock at your bunk: your night shift starts at {time}.
== night.knock.1
- A knock at your bunk. Calder: "Up you get. Night shift. I'll see you down there."
== night.knock.from
- The night crew
== night.plate
- Brennan's kept you a plate: "Night shift? Eat, then sleep." Find a seat and tap it.
== night.plate.dish
- the plate kept for you

// ---- Calder's word (meeting night.on, Day 22 09:15) and the end (night.off, Day 25 06:00) ----
== night.on.notice
- Night shift tonight from 22:45, after the comet. Then 21:00 to 06:00 till Wednesday.
== mail.night.on
- Your nights | As I said: Navarro's on leave. You cover his nights, tonight from 22:45 (after the comet), then 21:00 to 06:00, to Wednesday. Sleep this afternoon. I'll come and get you.
== night.off.notice
- Your nights are done. Navarro's back Friday night. Bed: you've a cadet tomorrow.
== mail.night.off
- Off nights | Three clean nights. Navarro's back Friday night. Sleep today; tomorrow you've a cadet with you.

// ---- the notices and the arrows at each step ----
== night.notice
- Night shift at {time}. Clock in at the Works bay, then the engine room on Deck 6.
== night.notice.1
- Night shift now. Clock in at the Works bay, then down to the engine room.
== night.notice.busy
- Your night shift starts at {time}. Turn in or drop this job first.
== night.ptr.in
- Night shift: clock in
== night.ptr.room
- Night shift: the engine room
== night.ptr.out
- Clock out: the night's done
== night.ptr.plate
- A plate's kept for you in the mess
== night.ptr.bed
- Sleep until {time}
== night.ptr.dayout
- Clock out, then sleep
== night.ptr.bed.22
- Sleep now: night shift tonight
== night.sleep.notice
- Sleep now: night shift tonight. Your bunk, until 16:45.
== night.plate.notice
- A plate's kept for you in the mess, from 06:15. Then sleep until {time}.
